# Common packages for every Cybroid OS desktop ISO.
# cybroidos-base and cybroidos-desktop are local .deb files installed by the
# chroot hook; everything here comes from the Debian 13 archive.
calamares
calamares-settings-debian
plymouth
sddm
sddm-theme-debian-breeze
spice-vdagent
kdeconnect
krdp
cybroidos-control
# Debian 13 has no standalone `kcd` package; kdeconnect ships the desktop
# KDE Connect daemon. Headless `kcd` remains a server/pods concern (ADR-0004).
